cription":"former country","inception":1710,"dissolved":1898,"enwiki":"Kong Empire","summary":"The Kong Empire (1710–1898), also known as the Wattara Empire or Ouattara Empire for its founder Seku Watara, was a pre-colonial state centered in what is now northeastern Ivory Coast that also encompassed much of present-day Burkina Faso and parts of Mali and Ghana.  It established a largely decentralized commercial empire based upon linkages between merchant houses, protecting trade routes throughout the region. Kong rose to prominence in the 1700s as a key commercial center and center of Islamic studies.  In 1898, Samori Ture attacked the city and burnt it down."}],"facts":[{"qid":"Q1587244","kind":"capital","value_qid":"Q1781511","value_label":"Kong","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P36","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Kong"},{"qid":"Q1587244","kind":"official_language","value_qid":"Q32706","value_label":"Dioula","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P37","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Dioula"},{"qid":"Q1587244","kind":"official_language","value_qid":"Q33795","value_label":"Senufo","from_t":null,"to_t":null,"title":null,"property":"P37","retrieved":"2026-10-30","vl":"Senufo"}],"people":{},"media":{},"names":["Empire Kong","Empire de Kong","Imperio Kong","Impero di Kong","Império de Congue","Kong","Kong Empire","Kong Krallığı","Kong-Reich","Reich Kong","Wattara","Империя Конг","Конг","Конг (империя)","империя Ваттара","империя Уатара","コング帝国","コン帝国","孔帝國","孔格帝國"]}